WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:07.547
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:11.623
What do they see?

3
00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:16.917
They see an art studio.

4
00:00:16.918 --> 00:00:27.518
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:27.519 --> 00:00:33.887
They use some markers.

6
00:00:33.888 --> 00:00:49.304
They use some scissors.

7
00:00:49.305 --> 00:01:09.503
They use some clay.

8
00:01:09.504 --> 00:01:32.413
They use some brushes.

9
00:01:32.414 --> 00:01:46.273
They use some paint.

10
00:01:46.274 --> 00:01:54.185
They use their fingers.

11
00:01:54.186 --> 00:02:00.200
Blobs, go wash your hands!

12
00:02:00.201 --> 00:02:08.631
Oh! What a nice painting!

13
00:02:08.632 --> 00:02:12.453
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:12.454 --> 00:02:15.451
Good-bye!

